v22-Final-Official-Summary.pdf","official",1]],"why":["This office has several seats, filled at different times, and the record does not say which earlier contest was for the seat on this ballot, so none is shown.","No earlier contest for this seat is among the past results held here."],"d":{"g":1,"w":1},"g":[[["2020","2022","2024"],"Every contest by precinct, ward, city or township","The Missouri Secretary of State publishes results by county only and sells the precinct files ('To purchase precinct data files ... contact the Elections Division'); nothing is bought for this record.","https://www.sos.mo.gov/elections/results"],[["2020","2022","2024"],"Kansas City as a whole","Kansas City lies in four counties; only its Jackson County part has an election authority of its own, so the parts in Clay, Platte and Cass counties are counted with those counties and cannot be told apart.","https://www.sos.mo.gov/elections/results"]]}